PRIVACY & SECURITY STATEMENT
============================================================================

This application is local-first by design:
  • All user data (manuscripts, notes, covers, statistics) is stored
    exclusively on the user's device (IndexedDB / localStorage).
  • The app contains no analytics, no tracking, no telemetry,
    no third-party SDKs collecting data.
  • No accounts, no servers, no cloud — nothing leaves the device.

